#: extensions/site-logo-option/extension.php:14
msgid "Site logo in General settings"
msgstr "Logo witryny w Ustawieniach ogólnych"

#: extensions/site-logo-option/extension.php:15
msgid ""
"Adds a site logo picker to Settings → General, so the logo can be changed "
"without opening the site editor."
msgstr ""
